graph TD
    Plan[Plan + relevant spaces<br/>genie_route_plan per space] --> GenieNode[sql_synthesis_genie_node]
    GenieNode --> Validate{Inputs available?}
    Validate -->|missing spaces or plan| SummaryNext[Set synthesis_error<br/>summarize]
    Validate -->|yes| Loop{loop_reason?}

    Loop -->|retry| Retry[Inject retry guidance<br/>use individual Genie tools]
    Loop -->|sequential_next| Sequential[Disable stale route plan<br/>choose one Genie room]
    Loop -->|none| Direct[Use routed Genie plan]

    Retry --> Agent[SQL Synthesis Genie Agent]
    Sequential --> Agent
    Direct --> Agent

    Agent --> Tools[Create tools only for<br/>relevant Genie spaces]
    Tools --> Mode{Active route plan?}
    Mode -->|yes| Parallel[Parallel Genie invocation<br/>one question per space]
    Mode -->|no| ToolCalls[LLM tool calling<br/>select individual Genie room]

    Parallel --> Outputs[Per-space answers<br/>SQL + reasoning]
    ToolCalls --> Outputs
    Outputs --> Merge[Merge routed outputs<br/>and synthesize final SQL]
    Merge --> Extract[Extract SQL blocks<br/>and query labels]
    Extract --> Result{Result type}
    Result -->|NO_MORE_QUERIES| Done[Use preserved results<br/>summarize]
    Result -->|SQL found| Exec[Set next_agent<br/>sql_execution]
    Result -->|no SQL or error| SummaryNext

    classDef agentClass fill:#4A90E2,stroke:#2E5C8A,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef dataClass fill:#50C878,stroke:#2E7D4E,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef processClass fill:#F5A623,stroke:#C17D11,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef decisionClass fill:#8E44AD,stroke:#6C3483,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff

    class GenieNode,Agent agentClass
    class Plan,Outputs,Exec,Done,SummaryNext dataClass
    class Retry,Sequential,Direct,Tools,Parallel,ToolCalls,Merge,Extract processClass
    class Validate,Loop,Mode,Result decisionClass
